	(text "Aegis Core is a custom surface-mount \nmicrocontroller development board \nengineered specifically to power\ncompact, automated, vision-tracked \nhardware systems like automated Nerf \nlaunch turrets. Built around the \nhigh-performance Raspberry Pi \nRP2350A microcontroller, this board \nintegrates full power management, \nUSB-C interfacing, high-frequency low-side\nmotor driving, and precise multi-servo \narticulation into a single, highly \nintegrated PCB."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 247.396 49.276 0)
		(effects
